flowchart LR
    client[ZedStorm Codex panel or external MCP client]
    stdio[Editor executable --context-mcp]
    endpoint[Private endpoint file keyed by canonical root]
    bridge[Authenticated loopback bridge in ai]
    project[Live GPUI Project and buffers]
    servers[Existing language servers]
    disk[Project filesystem]
    client <-->|stdio JSON-RPC| stdio
    stdio -->|discover each semantic call| endpoint
    stdio <-->|authenticated request and bounded result| bridge
    bridge -->|foreground entity access| project
    project <-->|typed LSP commands| servers
    stdio -->|filesystem tools| disk
    bridge -->|publish and remove on workspace lifetime| endpoint
